name sdrt
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc Macros for Segmented Discourse Representation Theory
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides macros to produce the 'Box notation' of
longdesc SDRT (and DRT), to draw trees representing discourse relations,
longdesc and finally to have an easy access to various mathematical
longdesc symbols used in that theory, mostly with automatic mathematics
longdesc mode, so they work the same in formulae and in text.
runfiles size=3
